    "disclosures": [
      {
        "id": "D1",
        "from": 2,
        "to": 2,
        "text": "本书出场角色均已满18岁，不存在任何未成年人。",
        "channel": "author",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": []
      },
      {
        "id": "D2",
        "from": 6,
        "to": 6,
        "text": "苏天晴吐掉嘴里的牙膏泡沫，放下猫猫水杯与牙刷，双手撑住洗手池，抬眼看镜中的金毛狐狐。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "STQ"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D3",
        "from": 7,
        "to": 7,
        "text": "镜中狐狐五官无可挑剔、精致可爱，毛发柔顺、肌肤光滑，能从宽松睡衣领口瞥见浅浅河谷，眼眸惊讶又魅惑。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "STQ"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D4",
        "from": 8,
        "to": 8,
        "text": "抛开听起来很离谱的反派魔法少女身份不谈，这副身体的模样绝妙中的绝妙。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "STQ",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "BODY",
          "VILLAIN_MG"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D5",
        "from": 9,
        "to": 14,
        "text": "这副身体每一个细节都满足苏天晴曾经的幻想，让人想细细品尝；苏天晴觉得自己太可爱，萝莉本身就是最美妙的奖励。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "STQ",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "BODY"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D6",
        "from": 17,
        "to": 17,
        "text": "苏天晴察觉自己刚才的举动很像变态，脸颊微红、轻咳两声收敛发癫，开始认真审视身体中残留的记忆。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "STQ",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "BODY"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D7",
        "from": 18,
        "to": 20,
        "text": "这副身体的原主人叫苏天晴；这里与苏天晴曾经的世界相差无几，但人类与兽人共存，兽人指猫娘狐娘而不是地里长出的绿皮菌子；兽人数量远不及人类，原主苏天晴从小孤独长大、社恐孤僻，靠兽人互助协会资助考上蓉城最好的医学院，临近开学染上兽人流感，熬夜时突发暴发性心肌炎。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "ORIGINAL",
          "BODY",
          "BEASTFOLK",
          "ORG",
          "RONGCHENG"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D8",
        "from": 21,
        "to": 21,
        "text": "原主的死法和自己一模一样。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "STQ",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "ORIGINAL"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D9",
        "from": 25,
        "to": 25,
        "text": "苏天晴简单洗漱后走到客厅，躺上沙发，顺手从茶几上拿起刚才那本跟自己说话的古书。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "BOOK"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D10",
        "from": 26,
        "to": 26,
        "text": "苏天晴问古书：“……喂？小破书你在吗？”",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "STQ",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "BOOK"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D11",
        "from": 27,
        "to": 28,
        "text": "古书沉默，没有像刚才那样开口说话，仿佛床头那件事压根没发生过。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "BOOK"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D12",
        "from": 29,
        "to": 29,
        "text": "苏天晴揣着一丝侥幸怀疑所谓的反派魔法少女根本不存在。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "conjecture",
        "holder": "STQ",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "VILLAIN_MG"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D13",
        "from": 33,
        "to": 33,
        "text": "一枚金色十字星从书里掉出，狠狠砸在毫无防备的苏天晴脸上。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "STAR"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D14",
        "from": 36,
        "to": 36,
        "text": "金色十字星上沾染的鼻血在一阵微弱光芒后悄然融入十字星中消失不见。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "STAR"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D15",
        "from": 37,
        "to": 37,
        "text": "一道陌生的声音在狐狐脑子里响起。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "SYSTEM_VOICE"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D16",
        "from": 38,
        "to": 38,
        "text": "【守护之星激活】",
        "channel": "in-world-system",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "SYSTEM_VOICE",
        "about": [
          "STAR"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D17",
        "from": 39,
        "to": 39,
        "text": "【秘典序章已完成，开启每日任务】",
        "channel": "in-world-system",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "SYSTEM_VOICE",
        "about": [
          "BOOK",
          "DAILY_TASK"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D18",
        "from": 40,
        "to": 40,
        "text": "苏天晴对每日任务、守护之星感到惊讶，觉得对方来真的。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "STQ",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "DAILY_TASK",
          "STAR",
          "SYSTEM_VOICE"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D19",
        "from": 42,
        "to": 42,
        "text": "苏天晴认为这枚材质不明、做工精致的金色十字星应该是魔法少女必备的变身道具。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "conjecture",
        "holder": "STQ",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "STAR"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D20",
        "from": 43,
        "to": 43,
        "text": "苏天晴想知道所谓的每日任务要怎么查看。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "question",
        "holder": "STQ",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "DAILY_TASK"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D21",
        "from": 47,
        "to": 47,
        "text": "苏天晴想到魔法少女变身、穿华丽洋装在城间穿梭飞行并与怪人战斗，并想到这具身体的原主人也曾梦想过这种场面。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "STQ",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "ORIGINAL",
          "VILLAIN_MG"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D22",
        "from": 50,
        "to": 50,
        "text": "苏天晴试探性喊出“变……变身！”",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "request",
        "holder": "STQ",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "STAR"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D23",
        "from": 53,
        "to": 56,
        "text": "苏天晴连续喊出“魔法少女变身！”“henshin！”“光啊！”“盖亚！！”等变身词。",
        "channel": "speech",
        "mode": "request",
        "holder": "STQ",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "STAR"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D24",
        "from": 57,
        "to": 57,
        "text": "苏天晴把能想到的变身词全喊了一遍，嗓子都快喊哑，十字星仍无动静。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "STAR"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D25",
        "from": 58,
        "to": 58,
        "text": "苏天晴抱怨秘典不给新手指引，不像别人拿到系统多少有新手任务教怎么变身。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "STQ",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "BOOK",
          "DAILY_TASK"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D26",
        "from": 63,
        "to": 64,
        "text": "苏天晴试探着将拇指摁进十字星中间的凹陷，光芒顷刻间笼罩客厅。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "STAR"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D27",
        "from": 65,
        "to": 65,
        "text": "白光转瞬消失，身体各处传来轻盈触感，脑海中莫名响起声音。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "SYSTEM_VOICE"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D28",
        "from": 66,
        "to": 66,
        "text": "【初次变身，已完成】",
        "channel": "in-world-system",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "SYSTEM_VOICE",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "STAR"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D29",
        "from": 68,
        "to": 68,
        "text": "苏天晴意识到原来是触摸屏，不是声控。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": "STQ",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "STAR"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D30",
        "from": 73,
        "to": 73,
        "text": "变身后苏天晴穿着过膝白袜、金色短款洋装，边缘缀缎带，胸前领口有闪亮金色十字星，身后有毛茸茸大尾巴，头上有两只耳朵。",
        "channel": "narrator",
        "mode": "assertion",
        "holder": null,
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "STAR"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D31",
        "from": 74,
        "to": 75,
        "text": "看到变身后的模样，苏天晴对反派魔法少女这个强行安排身份的最后抵触荡然无存，决定当反派魔法少女。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "plan",
        "holder": "STQ",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "VILLAIN_MG"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D32",
        "from": 77,
        "to": 77,
        "text": "苏天晴想接下来该看看所谓的每日任务是怎么回事。",
        "channel": "thought",
        "mode": "plan",
        "holder": "STQ",
        "about": [
          "STQ",
          "DAILY_TASK"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "D33",
        "from": 79,
        "to": 84,
